1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,000
Do you... truly know... Lord Vishnu?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,150
The three worlds are his body...
come, let us know that Vishnu.

3
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,100
The Earth... is his feet.

4
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:19,360
The underworld... the soles of his feet.

5
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,350
The rivers... his veins.

6
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:30,460
The trees... the hair on his body.

7
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,840
The sky... his navel.

8
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,160
The wind... his breath.

9
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:49,550
The Moon and the Sun... his eyes.

10
00:01:00,109 --> 00:01:07,988
[Sanskrit, Bhagavad Gita 11.7]
Here... in my body... see the whole universe,
moving and unmoving, as one

11
00:01:07,988 --> 00:01:14,429
and whatever else you wish to see.

